# Home Assistant terminology

Use the exact Home Assistant name when helping someone find a control. Use a short household explanation when helping them understand it. Keep a person's chosen name and any identifier they need to copy unchanged.

This dated supplement applies [Words and style](words-and-style.html), including WG-021 on native labels and WG-025 on literal values. The `HT-` references identify terminology entries, not new writing rules. No native translation, device name or configuration is changed by this guide.

